msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "509784"
msgid "Agh! Everyone here has that cowardly NPC look\non their face! Where have all the\nself-respecting Masters gone!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510436"
msgid "But, I just can't remember his name.\nThough I've seen him before, I may have\nnever actually talked to or fought him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510628"
msgid "…and now he's noticed me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510800"
msgid "My name is #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF. I've navigated through\nmany flavors of theology; attained many\ntruths; a super truth-seeking monk, I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511076"
msgid "No Servant…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511104"
msgid "Is that… even possible in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nNo Servant means you were defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511768"
msgid "\"Of course,\" I immediately reply.\nWe're trapped here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511872"
msgid "I haven't thought about escaping.\n…hmmm.\n#[Lad][Lass]#, somosan!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511944"
msgid "Somosan?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513424"
msgid "…and, he's gone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513448"
msgid "For now, I got one person to cooperate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513800"
msgid "…#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF can't be left as she is now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513864"
msgid "Hm? It's odd for me to be supporting #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\nYou say I was more reckless and macho\nin the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521884"
msgid "…ah, hrm. I mistook him for the sun.\nWhat an incredible God-V series.\nHow about calling him Red-wing #RUBS   Schwarz#RUBEJet-Black#REND Sun?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522128"
msgid "………\n…………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522376"
msgid "Oh? A Cat Keychain.\nSo if I can find it―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522872"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. If you happen to find the\n#C000246204Cat Keychain#CDEF first, would you mind bringing\nit to me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533996"
msgid "Hey, I have a somewhat rare ticket.\nWanna buy it?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "534176"
msgid "No thanks……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534192"
msgid "Oh! Thanks!\nAlright, here's the ticket."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "548908"
msgid "Alright, here you go.\nIt's a wedding veil decorated with the leaves\nyou brought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549200"
msgid "You liked it?\n…okay, that's good then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578304"
msgid "…but, with no chalk, I gave up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578584"
msgid "\"Fuck you, sunset!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579000"
msgid "Could it really be that she thinks\nshe \"has no more secrets\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579792"
msgid "But, no program is perfect. Even if each\nindividual part is perfect, when two parts\ncollide, the reaction can breed flaws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579992"
msgid "If you can agitate, or even make #C236196003Rani#CDEF excited,\nyou might be able to get a glimpse of her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580120"
msgid "…the hell are you―― Don't talk to me!\nUnlike you, I'm busy, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580520"
msgid "Did you know? Conflict only breaks out\nbetween those of equal levels.\nKid bait only baits kids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580628"
msgid "Thaaat aside…\nWhy do you know about Darling's problems?\nDid you eavesdrop in so-me-whe-re, hmmm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581416"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't know much about real,\ninterpersonal relationships. Do you, #C236196003Karna#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582108"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's final secret… Hmm.\nIt's difficult to say, since I've never met\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF… What's your take, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582740"
msgid "…are you serious? A harpy like you should\nbe able to smell a fragrant girl's pretension\nall the way from the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583000"
msgid "…I don't understand what you mean, but…\nhave you completely figured out #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583108"
msgid "Yes. Thus, I can't give advice. Giving a girl's\nsecret to outsiders is the height of stupidity.\nLike praising flowers while you pluck them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583384"
msgid "Or what, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nAre you telling me to become an honest writer,\nputting the plain truth down with my pen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583516"
msgid "…*sigh*. You really are a pain to deal with.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease seek help from someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583996"
msgid "Bwahaha!\nYou think that I have money, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585076"
msgid "In contrast to those plump breasts and fairly\nhuge claws, #C236196003Lippy#CDEF seems terribly shy.\nI hope we can start off as friends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585324"
msgid "For I am a MAN before I am a monk!\nI can't resist boob magic! Gah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586204"
msgid "You may think I'M meddlesome,\nbut when it comes to being meddlesome,\nI don't hold a candle to you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588108"
msgid "We're in a crisis here… What's the harm\nin letting me forget that I'm an NPC\nand all that…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588204"
msgid "The end of mankind, huh…\nThat sure is a shock…\nI'm just as shocked as you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588796"
msgid "I may just be an NPC,\nbut I'm rooting for you all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590188"
msgid "It took 108 suggestions to get to this\nthough. I wish he would've been\nquicker on the uptake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590384"
msgid "………I'm, alive………\nWas that, a dream…?\nWhat the hell is going on…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590548"
msgid "But… what was the normal world like, again…?\nWhy were we here… laughing, again?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590800"
msgid "…………so that's how it was.\nHe wasn't the carefree one, I was…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590880"
msgid "He was at his wit's end, oblivious…\nI was REALLY oblivious…\nLike two peas in a pod… hehe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590988"
msgid "But, I know I'm the terrible one here.\nI can't believe my own feelings,\nthat I like him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591848"
msgid "Losing a Master here would impede the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. I ask that you act calmly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592736"
msgid "So #C236196003BB#CDEF made a new #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF?\nWith that and those #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\nher authority just keeps expanding…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592904"
msgid "We also want to come up with some way\nto counter #C236196003BB#CDEF, but… we just don't have enough\npower, even put together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593448"
msgid "So even Servants can become Sentinels…\nHow long is this mess going to continue…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593552"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594160"
msgid "We were born from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nSo, it's the child's given\nduty to witness the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594352"
msgid "I like this role.\nIf possible, the next time I reboot,\nI hope that I get to wear this uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595460"
msgid "Though you all may be Masters, our safety\nisn't guaranteed. My priority is saving\nmy own skin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595724"
msgid "Also, you've noticed it already, right?\nThat #C236196003BB#CDEF ignores us? All she cares\nabout is modding herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596212"
msgid "Our surrender to #C236196003BB#CDEF wasn't accepted…\nMy prediction was wrong…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596820"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's processing capabilities\nare catching up to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's…\nBut…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597484"
msgid "――――――\n――――――\n――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598804"
msgid "We're victims who were trapped by that rogue AI!\nPlease do something, quick!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599444"
msgid "I'm alive… I'm alive… I'm alive…\nAm… I… alive…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599584"
msgid "Hanging around such a lawless space is NOT sane!\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is the worst AI ever…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600336"
msgid "Oh, I'll study. Gotta study.\nSo long as I keep studying, I won't have to\ndeal with this reality…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600436"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600516"
msgid "Well, has nothing to do with me.\nI've done nothing this entire time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600588"
msgid "…#C236196003BB#CDEF certainly has lost her mind.\nBut you humans are just as\nmessed up in the head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601024"
msgid "If #RUBS an AI#RUBE#C236196003BB#CDEF#REND, evolved as she is,\nis no match for humans… then for what\npurpose were #RUBS  we #RUBENPCs#REND born…"
msgstr ""

