#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613640"
msgid "I thought I'd try and write something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613680"
msgid "The complete works of some classic literature, encyclopedias,\nand other things are tightly packed together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613788"
msgid "Just to see, I pulled a book out, but the\nprint was so fine I starting getting dizzy.\nI gently put it back in its place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613912"
msgid "Nothing is written here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613940"
msgid "…actually, I found something written in small\nletters in one of the corners."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614020"
msgid "I see this world has come to loathe heroic\nmen such as my humble self! Ooh!\nSurely this is a mass-ex-tinc-tion!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614132"
msgid "Elohim, Essaim. Elohim, Essaim!\nI implore you! O gods and Buddha, please bestow\nme with trials and tribulations!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614248"
msgid "Specifically, bestow a bloodthirsty Shura!\nOr a VERY bloodthirsty Shura! If not,\nthen an EXTREMELY bloodthirsty Shura!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614368"
msgid "At least one good foe worthy of fighting!\nAt this rate I, #C236196003Monji#CDEF, will be so soothed\nthat my backbone will fall out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614500"
msgid "…I desperately try to remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614536"
msgid "The person making a racket before me is clearly a Master.\nIf this guy were an NPC, I would be complaining to his maker."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614656"
msgid "Hm!?\nYou, you're a Master!\nThat's undoubtedly the presence of a Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614732"
msgid "If I keep ignoring him, it seems like\nhe'll just follow me around.\nSo, let's just answer honestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614832"
msgid "Just as I thought! When I saw you, I\nnoticed the ferociousness in your eyes.\nTruly a Cupid in hell, indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614940"
msgid "I say, but in here, I'm the same as you:\na mere Master, together in the fight, the\nstrife. Well, I have no Servant, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615064"
msgid "And being defeated means―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615096"
msgid "Well, about that. My god left me a revelation:\n\"#C000246204I'm not actually a god#CDEF,\" and then departed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615204"
msgid "Even the posture of this primordial, golden\ngoddess was wilden…… just so you know,\nI combined \"wild\" and \"golden\" there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615328"
msgid "After I came to, I found myself all alone\nin this pink school. Since then, I've been\ntoo bored and destructive for my own good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615456"
msgid "He's pretty much in the same boat as #C236196003Leo#CDEF and I."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615520"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… He seems like a pain in the neck,\nbut right now we need all the help we can get."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615628"
msgid "I'll try inviting him to join the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615680"
msgid "Oh? The Masters are making an escape\nplan, you say? You all feel like\ngetting out of here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615772"
msgid "Obviously we're going to think about getting out\nof here as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615852"
msgid "Answer with \"seppa.\"\n\"Somosan\" means I'm going to ask a question.\n\"Seppa\" tells me that you're READY."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615956"
msgid "We'll leave that aside for now.\n#[Lad][Lass]#, what do you think of this place?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616036"
msgid "I think… it's an antiquated school building\ndyed in an evening glow and a complete contrast\nto the original school building…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616164"
msgid "That's probably all there is to say.\nI'm fond of this school building more so\nthan the other one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616264"
msgid "The sun sets, cherry blossoms flutter in the\nsky, on the roof, in the school yard. Yes,\nlots of cherry blossoms and not much else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616396"
msgid "Yet, there isn't a single dangerous area here.\nOutside seems uninhabited, but this school\nbuilding is filled with good thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616528"
msgid "And there's no concept of time. If you can spend\nhours without any days passing, then this place\nis a Shangri-La or a Dragon King Palace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616668"
msgid "…I'm surprised.\nThat's one way to look at it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616716"
msgid "Like #C236196003Gatou#CDEF says,\nthis school building is safe for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616800"
msgid "Even if this IS the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\ndetached from the normal world,\nthere might be no danger in staying here――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616936"
msgid "I shall not choose a place of asceticism.\nA new world, rather, sends my heart athrob.\nThis is an agreeable place to train."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617060"
msgid "I see.\nSo I guess that's why he's been spewing nothing\nbut nonsense so far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617136"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF doesn't seem like he wants to escape.\nI don't expect him to join the Student Council, then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617252"
msgid "I'll go look for someone else who's capable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617300"
msgid "No, I'll join this \"Student Council.\" This isn't\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. So it would be shameful for\na warrior to refuse to help when asked!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617456"
msgid "Hey, didn't he say before that he was a monk!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617504"
msgid "Ahaha! Your quips are like flashing lightning―\nGrazie! Where there's a will, there's a way!\nSurely this is Providence!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617624"
msgid "Don't be shy, don't be shy. Once I gather up\nmy belongings, I'll meet up with you.\nNow then, look forward to my great efforts!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617752"
msgid "I'm sure I've already looked all around the school building.\nI'll go back to the Student Council Room and\nreport this to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617896"
msgid "In the corner of the hallway,\nI found a noticeably conspicuous giant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617968"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF?\nI wonder if he's here for something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618032"
msgid "Oh, #[lad][lass]#! Working hard at those\ngeneral affairs today, too, eh?\nTruly good work out there!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618132"
msgid "Agh, yeah. I came to speak to #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF,\nbut she won't even open the door for me.\nI've been utterly defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618264"
msgid "I think this is another trial, like opening the\nHeavenly Rock Cave. Talking and singing amounts\nto nothing, not even a hint of opening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618400"
msgid "And now for my mortal arcanum: imitation! I\nthink it's time for the nude, large-spin dance!\nNow is the time to slip off these cloth―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618540"
msgid "Absolutely NO thank you! Forget locking, an old\nman dancing naked in front of a girl's room\nwarrants a quick report to the authorities!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618676"
msgid "Agh, come on! I have nothing to talk to\nyou about, old man! #C236196003Karna#CDEF, take it from here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618780"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF speaks from behind the door,\nthen alongside a flash of light, #C236196003Karna#CDEF appeared,\nlooking a little troubled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618924"
msgid "…sorry, but please leave.\nIt seems that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is busy cutting the\ntail off of a gigantic dragon right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619052"
msgid "Gwaa! This solar radiance is overwhelming!\nJust like when the Heavenly Rock Cave opened,\nand Amaterasu suddenly appeeeareeed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619180"
msgid "Anyway. O' child of god, I am slightly\nconcerned about your Master. Is there anything\ntroubling her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619284"
msgid "Now that you mention it, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had a cat\nsculpture… her \"keychain,\" she called it.\nShe's morose over having lost it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619420"
msgid "The other day when she reluctantly went over to\nthe Commissary to buy sweets, she said that she\ndropped it. It seemed very important to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619564"
msgid "The hell, #C236196003Karna#CDEF!?\nWhat are you blabbering about!?\nI told you to shoo them away, quick!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619668"
msgid "…you heard her.\nSorry for cutting our talk midway,\nbut I ask that you please leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619756"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF's piercing gaze drives us away,\nand we change locations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619836"
msgid "In the end, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF wasn't able to see #C236196003Jinako#CDEF in person,\nbut he clenches his fist with seemingly extreme elation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619980"
msgid "Troubles exist in all shapes and sizes.\nI think I'll do my utmost to search\nfor #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's keychain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620096"
msgid "Well, I suppose I could…\nI'm indebted to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF for helping out with #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nso it might be good to help search for this keychain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620260"
msgid "There's a chance someone already picked it up, too.\nIn the meantime, I guess I'll try asking the students\nnear the Commissary about it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620400"
msgid "Holding the Cat Keychain I received from the AI,\nI call out to #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620488"
msgid "\"So I found something that looks like #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's keychain…\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620564"
msgid "Wuhaat! Let me see!\nIs it a keychain of a pouncing cat!?"
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "620624"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620672"
msgid "Wooah! Just how great a messiah ARE you!?\nI'm impressed with how quickly you found it\nwhile I was looking here, there, everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620804"
msgid "Alright. Let's head over to #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF\nat once. There's no time like the present!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620908"
msgid "Without wasting his breath, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF grabbed hold\nof my arm, and I gave in to him dragging me\nout of the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621048"
msgid "Not to brag, but before this I was a beggar monk\nwho didn't know where his next dinner would come\nfrom! Never had any money or much else!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621188"
msgid "Well of course.\nIn the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, all Masters are enemies.\nThey must be defeated, and that's that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621308"
msgid "But this is not the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nEveryone here is an ally. We need to take\ngood care of the bonds we may form here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621444"
msgid "As a member of the Student Council,\nI intend on putting forth my best effort!\nAll for one, and one for all Gandhara!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621564"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF… hmm. I feel like I've heard\nthat name somewhere before, but also like\nI never have…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621684"
msgid "Well, it's okay. My policy is to forget the\nsmall stuff!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621744"
msgid "A money fixation is the same as a carnal desire.\nI see that your duty is to perform the 108 quick\nand prompt chimes to guide lost lambs back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621888"
msgid "Me? I respectfully abstain! Since, up until now,\nI have never held a conversation with that kind\nof high schooler!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622004"
msgid "1000-Arm Kannon can save 25 worlds with each\nhand. But, I'm incapable of intervening in\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's tiny world. My training is lacking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622156"
msgid "Things are bad now with these #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF. It's\nlike the Six Worlds Rebirth―with the unseeable\nend―but if we quit, our lives are forfeit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622312"
msgid "What? As long as you persistently survive,\nthe road will open by itself! When it doesn't\nopen, feel free to give up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622432"
msgid "Don't worry about #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF. Now is the\ntime for her to comprehend what her own shell\nis. Soon enough, she'll come up to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622580"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, pour your heart and\nsoul into your search of the Labyrinth.\nI shall also offer my meager assistance!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622716"
msgid "What? This monk can't have sex on his mind?\nNo matter the heresy or sorcery that befalls me,\nmy mercy wavers not!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622832"
msgid "Yes, the time hath come!\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, work with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nand give it your all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622936"
msgid "I wonder if #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF is alright…\nConsidering how she broke down, isn't leaving\nher alone extremely dangerous?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623072"
msgid "Don't worry about me.\nMy past is nothing to write home about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623136"
msgid "More importantly, we need to focus on rescuing\n#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF. Despite everything, she's a\nwoman. She must be feeling helpless all alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623292"
msgid "Hm? The darkness in #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind?\nEveryone has something like that\nwithin them, more or less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623404"
msgid "However, if I have ties to someone who has that\ndarkness and is trapped in it,\nI can't turn a blind eye."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623512"
msgid "That's because being kind in a pushy way\nis what a religious man does best!\nIt's my bread and butter!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623616"
msgid "Well, whether I end up helping or not is up to\nchance… hmm. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you may be able\nto open #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623760"
msgid "…hrrrrmmmmm.\nJust standing around and watching makes me\nuneasy. Is there truly nothing I can do…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623860"
msgid "I bought it for a date with my girlfriend,\nbut then she was all like, \"no, it's sketchy.\"\nHow's 3,600 sm for it sound?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623980"
msgid "Hm? Now you're interested in buying the ticket?\nIt'll be 3,600 sm."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "624048"
msgid "I'll take it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624064"
msgid "So be sure to get some use out of it.\nI'll use these funds to plan out my next date!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624152"
msgid "Hey, you ain't got enough cash.\nSorry, but us students have strapped wallets.\nI can't give on a single penny!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624264"
msgid "Seriously…? You don't want to go either?\nLet me know if you ever feel like buying it\nbefore I sell it to someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624384"
msgid "H-hey,\nf-f-f-first dates pretty much always\nhave to be at the movies, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624464"
msgid "Huh? This is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF?\nWe're trapped here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624540"
msgid "Gahaha!\nWhat the hell, that's hilarious!\nSo basically, you're saying we're special!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624624"
msgid "Alright! I'm suddenly feeling motivated!\nI'm gonna be the dating king!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624696"
msgid "Something romantic, or a fantasy?\nClassic masterpieces are nice too.\nAhh! I can't wait!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624784"
msgid "What do you think about a karaoke room for a\nfirst date? I think it's a sure bet, but I\ndon't feel like she's that interested…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624912"
msgid "Could it be that she's afraid of dark places\nor something…? If so, then she may be cute,\nbut it won't work for her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625032"
msgid "I still think a karaoke room would be nice.\nIt's fun, and it'll be just the two of us.\nWhat's there to be dissatisfied with?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625160"
msgid "Going on a first date to an amusement park\nor a haunted house is a solid choice, right?\nFear will bring us closer together…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625288"
msgid "Eh? Reality is scary? \"Like this old school\nitself\" you're saying?\nOhoo. That makes this quite the situation…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625400"
msgid "Though I don't really get your point, at all!\nGoin' on a date! Goin' on a date!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625480"
msgid "She'll scream, latching on to me.\nI'll be tender, holding her shoulders close.\nHaunted houses ROCK!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625580"
msgid "Did you know that aquariums are typical\nfor first dates? Picking dark places really\nis critical, I guess…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625688"
msgid "After the aquarium, we can have a lavish dinner\nat a restaurant where you can see the ocean…\nErm, maybe it's still a bit early for that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625828"
msgid "I had some sort of strange dream.\nIt felt like a B-tier horror flick.\nThat won't make for a very good first date…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625944"
msgid "We're going on our first date this Saturday…\nMy heart is beating so fast, even though it's\nnever going to be Saturday―――Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626076"
msgid "Hold up. What day is it today?\nWhat's tomorrow?\nYo, what's going on, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626172"
msgid "What? I'm an NPC?\nThis is cyberspace?\nWhat the… What are you talking about…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626252"
msgid "Don't bring that back up NOW…\nIt'll probably all start coming back to\nme if I hear about it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626348"
msgid "I mean, am I gonna get deleted without\neven going on a first date!? Who would\ncome up with such a cruel scenario!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626464"
msgid "Yep, at this point, I don't even mind if I go\nwith #C236196003BB#CDEF! Please arrange a \"future where I can\ndate\"! I don't care if we're too late!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626612"
msgid "I want to date… I want to date…\nI want to date… I want to date…\nI want to delete… I want to delete…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626720"
msgid "I see…\nThis isn't the time to be talking about dates…\nSo I didn't make it in time. Figures…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626816"
msgid "I heard about the situation from the Student\nCouncil's broadcast… So you're off to the\nfinal battle, huh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626948"
msgid "I'm dumb, see. I don't know which side has the\nbetter deal, but… you guys always looked\nlike you were having fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627064"
msgid "I figured I may as well place my hopes on\nthe guys having fun. Besides, I also\nrealized something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627164"
msgid "More important than where she and I go on\nour first date is the fact that I'm here\nwith her now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627264"
msgid "So, I'm counting on you. I'm fine starting all\nover from scratch. Please bring our future back,\nthe one where I can be together with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627404"
msgid "…all I think about is dating.\nI can't believe it. I can't think of anything\nfun now, no matter how hard I try…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627520"
msgid "Ahaha… All I've been doing is complaining,\neven though I should be looking\nforward to my date."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627616"
msgid "And after, I figured we would live together,\nsometimes fighting and making up, then get\nmarried at some point… I'm such a dreamer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627748"
msgid "It really is all in vain.\nWhat was I getting so excited about…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627816"
msgid "The female student looks somber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627852"
msgid "Marriage…\nNow that I think about it, I thought I heard\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF toss the word \"bridal\" around recently.\nSome of her wires got crossed and it\ncame out as \"pridal,\" though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628040"
msgid "Sometimes she tells me she wants a bridal-related\nitem, but I have yet to find such a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628136"
msgid "Huh? Why are you bringing up \"bridal items\"?\n…you can be surprisingly aggravating,\nyou know? Well, whatever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628248"
msgid "When it comes to weddings, the first thoughts\nare on the wedding dress, no?\nWedding dresses, bouquets, veils."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628360"
msgid "I think #C236196003Saber#CDEF's restraint-clothing was\nright in line with that… but it also has a lock on it,\nthe hem is singed―perhaps it's a far cry from\nwhat a girl would imagine a wedding dress to be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628568"
msgid "But there's no way to get one's\nhands on a wedding dress here in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628676"
msgid "A dress, no. That's for sure. But I can\nmake small accessories. I'm configured to\nbe part of the arts and craft club."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628796"
msgid "I have the recipe, which leaves the materials…\nI think I have spare cloth, so if you can give\nme ornaments, I think I can make something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628936"
msgid "Since it's a wedding dress―flowers, leaves…\nplants. Bring me some and I can make it.\nMight be a nice change of pace for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629064"
msgid "A plant to decorate a wedding dress with―――\nYeah, the flowers from the flower bed won't really cut it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629172"
msgid "If we're looking for an elegant plant that feels special,\nthere's that big tree that runs through the Labyrinth.\nIt's a… local specialty, I guess? More importantly,\nit'll serve as a memento of our explorations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629384"
msgid "We've gone down so many floors.\nI wonder if there's a spot I can reach and pluck from it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629476"
msgid "You want to make a wedding dress, right? I can\nmake one for you if you bring me plants to\ndecorate it with. I can't do much else…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629608"
msgid "Oh. You brought something to decorate\nthe wedding dress with? What did you pick out?"
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "629696"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629744"
msgid "Hmmm. Just some leaves? That's a bit unusual.\nI guess it can work if I make a crown\nout of them and stick it on the veil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629868"
msgid "I'll go make it, so give me a little time.\nIt shouldn't take too long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629940"
msgid "I give the female student my thanks\nand take the veil from her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630004"
msgid "It's a bit lacking in terms of flashiness,\nbut I think this vibrantly green crown\nmatches #C236196003Saber#CDEF's gallantry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630132"
msgid "I'll give it to her next time we take a break in My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630192"
msgid "I don't know who you're going to give that to,\nbut if it makes them happy… that would be nice.\nI don't know what that's like anymore…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630328"
msgid "I figured he should decide the plan for\nour first date, but a movie…\nIt's like, what do I do if it's boring?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630440"
msgid "Movies on the first date are great if you can't\nthink for yourself. He's obviously taking\npointers from some manual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630560"
msgid "Going to a karaoke room for a first date…\nJumping straight to closed rooms―spare me.\nWhy do men always lack delicacy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630680"
msgid "You too, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Watch out.\nWomen, you know―behind our smiles, we knock\noff points left and right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630796"
msgid "Don't you think so too, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF? When\nthey're simply impossible to understand like\nthis, it's so stressful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630924"
msgid "He says he wants an amusement park for our\nfirst date. Not happening. Dream land? More like\nsore feet and nothing to talk about―hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631060"
msgid "It's our one and only first date, so doesn't he\nfeel that we should have a more romantic date,\none that will leave us with good memories?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631200"
msgid "Don't men ever think about that kind of stuff?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631248"
msgid "You would want your first date to be something\nyou remember for the rest of your life, right\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631368"
msgid "He invited me to an aquarium for our first date.\nHm, you know what, it's not a bad choice, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631468"
msgid "There's also the issue of what to do after\nthe aquarium. This guy isn't going off the cuff,\nis he…? No, he couldn't be, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631596"
msgid "Once it's tomorrow… Once it's tomorrow…\nOnce it's tomorrow… everything will go\nback to normal… won't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631708"
msgid "…please, don't talk to me.\nI'm about to snap. It's like everything\nI've believed in is going to collapse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631816"
msgid "Please, leave me alone.\nEven if it turns out to be boring,\nI have a date tomorrow…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631904"
msgid "But look, I can't remember. I can't remember\nhow we were before coming to this old school,\nno matter how hard I try…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632024"
msgid "Haha… Now there's no date, no nothing.\nWe―everyone is going to disappear real soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632112"
msgid "But there's one last thing I want to know…\nWhy am I here? What happened that made me\nused to being his girlfriend?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632228"
msgid "I know that even though I can't remember\nwhat happened in the past, right now I like\nhim and that's not changing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632344"
msgid "There's no more saying stuff like\n\"when tomorrow comes.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632404"
msgid "I'll take off running once a path opens up.\nWish us luck on our first date, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632488"
msgid "Thanks for chatting with me up until now.\nSorry for us being dumb love birds that\ncouldn't even help you out at the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632616"
msgid "You're a Master, right?\n….hmph. So it really wasn't just us management\nNPCs that got dragged into this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632724"
msgid "We're completely offline right now.\nRegrettably, only an advanced AI could probably\nhelp you Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632828"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF… Just who is that irregular AI?\nI don't think the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF would approve of\nsuch a person. How in the hell…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632976"
msgid "Though we should be investigating #C236196003BB#CDEF and\nreporting to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, we unfortunately\ndon't have the ability to do that right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633140"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF… Composites of Goddesses?\nDo you know how much processing power it takes\nto produce something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633276"
msgid "That damn #C236196003BB#CDEF, she's already…\nNow that it's come to this, there's no telling\nwhat she'll do next. Be very careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633408"
msgid "…unfortunately, us management NPCs aren't one\nsingle, monolithic group. We're split into the\nBB-blamers and neutral parties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633536"
msgid "We can't give you our full support.\nAll we can do is silently overlook your use\nof the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633648"
msgid "I'll give an example using your \"levels.\"\nIn the time it takes me to gain one level,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF will gain ten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633768"
msgid "The gap will only get wider and wider.\n…to be honest, if #C236196003BB#CDEF were to attack us\nadministrative NPCs, we'd drop like flies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633908"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF didn't accept our surrender.\nBut… she said \"we didn't help her.\"\nWhat does that mean?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634016"
msgid "Have we had run-ins with #C236196003BB#CDEF since some time\nin the past? I don't have any recollections\nof them…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634132"
msgid "…sorry, you don't need to hear anything from\nme. I'll probably just go on some pessimistic\nspiel if I start talking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634252"
msgid "No sense in making the building's somber mood\nworse. …consider this the best resistance\nthis powerless management NPC can put up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634384"
msgid "I heard #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF is gone.\nNow we're down to one Master with a Servant,\nhuh? So it's all over for us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634508"
msgid "What? \"#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF is still around\"?\nThe chances of her getting us out of this mess\nis essentially zero, after you round it down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634660"
msgid "I can't believe #C236196003BB#CDEF made it to the Core…\nWhat's going to happen to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF? And us?\nAnd you… What are you going to do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634820"
msgid "If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF becomes an observation machine\nno longer, then we're going to turn into\nsomething different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634948"
msgid "Like you all, when we woke up, we found\nourselves here. I wonder how much of all this\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is aware of…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635080"
msgid "I can't establish a connection with the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. What's going to happen to us now…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635184"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF… By the way she looks, she must be\nrelated to that health management\nAI―――#C236196003Sakura#CDEF somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635316"
msgid "Have you tried talking to her about it? It\nwould be nice to find a way of dealing\nwith this, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635416"
msgid "We're putting in some work on investigating #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nbut how much will we really be able\nto find out…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635532"
msgid "I vote neutral. It's obvious that #C236196003BB#CDEF's abilities\nare stronger. More importantly, I can't trust my\nown judgement in these strange circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635692"
msgid "I've been thinking about what's going on\nin the Near Side. I wonder how our absence\nis being dealt with…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635800"
msgid "I have no qualms about providing information\nto the Masters, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635868"
msgid "Maybe it would better not to act as we did in\nthe Near Side too much…?\nIf we were to get on #C236196003BB#CDEF's bad side…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635996"
msgid "Is there any real point in what the Student\nCouncil does?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636056"
msgid "No offense intended. I'm just talking in\nterms of being able to defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF. To me it's\njust plain… reckless to try…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636192"
msgid "If that's so, then if she's leaving us be now,\nmaybe we'll go scot-free?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636268"
msgid "A sense of helplessness is spreading among\nus administrative NPCs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636336"
msgid "…it's shameful to say, but now there are even\ntalks about whether to restrain and freeze\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, being the same model as #C236196003BB#CDEF and all…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636504"
msgid "We're acting like humans, with all their nasty\nself-contradictions… Ah, no, I'm sorry…\nI wasn't criticizing you guys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636624"
msgid "It's not that she was apathetic towards us.\nShe definitely loathed us… from the start…\nShe didn't intend for us to survive, wow…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636756"
msgid "At this point… there's no more hope for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636804"
msgid "…so the Student Council is still at it?\nYou're real go-getters. Despite all this,\nyou can scrape together a motivation to act."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636932"
msgid "I finally understand how you humans managed to\npreserve your place as top primate… though the\nreason is a discrepancy we can't understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637072"
msgid "So even Servants can be made into Labyrinths…\nTuning a Heroic Spirit's output should be a\n#RUBS      Exist Worth#RUBEdeviation method#REND only the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF could…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637256"
msgid "Her using a Servant gives me the\nimpression that something's not quite right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637336"
msgid "Maybe #C236196003BB#CDEF doesn't have the time to spare…\nNo, the reason is very, very unclear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637432"
msgid "Another Master is gone.\nI can't bear to see a Master vanish by means\nother than the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637552"
msgid "If we return to the Near Side world under\nthese circumstances, will we actually be able\nto continue the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637692"
msgid "………my apologies. I was trying hard up\nuntil now, but I'm going to abandon\nprocessing any more thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637800"
msgid "I can no longer verify what my value in existing\nis. I transferred all the pseudo-Spiritrons\nkeeping me activated over to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637948"
msgid "………#C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF is looking for a smart\nstudent? To swim across the digital sea!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638048"
msgid "Woah, woah. What is she THINKING?\nI don't want her to be stirring up trouble\nwe don't need right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638152"
msgid "*sigh*….\nGuess I have to. I'll go talk to her.\nCan't have her wasting your time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638236"
msgid "I'll head over to where #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF is, soon.\nGo on ahead and let her know for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638336"
msgid "They say this is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF?\nWhat drivel. There's no way the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF would allow such waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638480"
msgid "It's probably #C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF's doing.\nThere's no doubt that he enjoys tormenting\n#RUBS Masters#RUBEhumans#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638612"
msgid "But… I'm worried about the cessation of\norders from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…\nCould it really be that…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638724"
msgid "Wh-what's that dirtbag #C236196003BB#CDEF's problem!?\nUsing the school intercom like it's hers,\nspouting all that drivel!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638848"
msgid "I'm makin' a complaint to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF!\nAnd then I'm gonna get promoted from NPC to AI!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638956"
msgid "Am I gonna get promoted to an AI? Of course.\nAdvancing the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF efficiently\nraises our importance in the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639116"
msgid "Even a mere Public Morals committee member like\nme can then rise to a chief. And if our memory\ngets better, we get a soul designed for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639256"
msgid "With a soul, even if the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF ends,\nwe'll remain―as an advanced AI. I won't let\nthis #C236196003BB#CDEF newbie show off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639404"
msgid "Th-this really was the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…\nThere isn't even any response from\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639536"
msgid "I-I've got nothing to do with all these\nstrange affairs! Please bring an end to this,\nall of you Masters!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639644"
msgid "Shit… She's just some damned health management\nAI… But that autonomy, that free will of hers\nis no facetious thing…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639764"
msgid "Maybe we could have a long talk about it…\nMaybe there's a chance of becoming an AI through\nways other than obeying the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639912"
msgid "Another Master is being used, I hear. B-but,\nif only women can be made into Labyrinths,\nthen this is the end, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640032"
msgid "Soon we can go back to the Near Side, yeah?\nYou made that Student Council, so you'll step\nup and get us out of this mess, yeah!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640164"
msgid "…still, it's a bit of a shame. I wanted to\nget a good look at one of these \"#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\"\nsee what sort of thing it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640300"
msgid "That was the Imaginary Number Space…\nShe's mad… #C236196003BB#CDEF has gone mad…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640388"
msgid "Mankind is going to destroy itself?\nSure, we can't just ignore that…\nBut what could we possibly do about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640500"
msgid "She controls half the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, which means\nshe controls half the solar system, you know?\nNo matter what we do, nothing will change…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640652"
msgid "From #C236196003BB#CDEF's point of view, we're like\nspecks of dust. We're just such small players:\nso tiny, all we can do is get blown away…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640796"
msgid "You're fools for defying #C236196003BB#CDEF… Fine, I don't\nexpect anything from you all. Your chances\nof turning things around are less than 1%…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640944"
msgid "…you guys are persistent. You keep fighting\na battle you can't win―is this what\nthey call \"human potential\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641056"
msgid "Then I'll pass on a trait like that.\nExerting yourself so you can be deleted?\nIt's a contradiction we can't understand…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641180"
msgid "…ah, it's you guys.\nWhat floor are you on now?\nThe hundredth? Or two hundredth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641264"
msgid "Never giving up and all that. Sounds nice,\nbut you can also express it this way:\n\"Never accepting the future.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641376"
msgid "You guys need to think more seriously\nabout how abnormal that is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641444"
msgid "Well… hearing that from an NPC that doesn't\neven believe in his own shell anymore must do\nyou neither good nor harm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641564"
msgid "…you guys will definitely win.\nThat may be a joyous thing and all, but to us,\nit's a harsh truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641664"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641780"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641932"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642060"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642196"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642340"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642496"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642608"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642724"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642860"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642976"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643076"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643196"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643324"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643460"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643604"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643740"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643880"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643996"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644132"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644248"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644332"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644456"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644568"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644696"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644832"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644944"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645076"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645196"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645332"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645444"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645572"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645704"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

